      "isHidden": false,
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "本记录保存的税额（本币），按对应币种读取；不能从当前税率重算或与不同粒度重复累计。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKhelp/PCH3.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL",
      "displayName": "税额（本币）"
    },
    {
      "name": "VatSumFrgn",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "本记录保存的税额（外币），按对应币种读取；不能从当前税率重算或与不同粒度重复累计。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKhelp/PCH3.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL",
      "displayName": "税额（外币）"
    },
    {
      "name": "VatSumSy",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "本记录保存的税额（系统币），按对应币种读取；不能从当前税率重算或与不同粒度重复累计。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKhelp/PCH3.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL",
      "displayName": "税额（系统币）"
    },
    {
      "name": "DistrbMthd",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "N不分摊、Q数量、V体积、W重量、E平均、T行总额；只是保存的方法，不等于已有逐物料分摊金额。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKhelp/PCH3.html"
      },
      "type": "CHAR",
      "displayName": "费用分摊方法"
    },
    {
      "name": "TaxStatus",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "Y应税，N非应税；保存值不取代当地税务规则。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKhelp/PCH3.html"
      },
      "type": "CHAR",
      "displayName": "应税标志"
    },
    {
      "name": "TaxDistMtd",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "保存的费用税额分摊方法，与费用本身DistrbMthd分开；不等于已保存逐物料分摊金额，不据此重算历史税额。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKhelp/PCH3.html"
      },
      "type": "CHAR",
      "displayName": "费用税额分摊方法"
    },
    {
      "name": "TaxType",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "Y普通税、N无税、U使用税；保持地区化适用边界。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKhelp/PCH3.html"
      },
      "type": "CHAR",
      "displayName": "税类型"
    },
    {
      "name": "VatGroup",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "本记录税组，关联OVTG.Code；与TaxCode对应的其他税配置分开，不用当前税组重算历史税额。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKhelp/PCH3.html"
      },
      "type": "VARCHAR",
      "displayName": "税组代码"
    },
    {
      "name": "VatPrcnt",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "本记录保存税率；税额读取保存值，不据税率重算复杂税费。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKhelp/PCH3.html"
      },
      "type": "DECIMAL",
      "displayName": "税率"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "本记录保存的项目代码，关联OPRJ；头项目与行项目分别使用，不相互覆盖。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKhelp/PCH3.html"
      },
      "type": "VARCHAR",
      "displayName": "项目代码"
    },
    {
      "name": "Comments",
      "isCalculated": false,
      "isHidden": false,
      "notNull": false,
      "properties": {
        "description": "本费用记录备注；不代替结构化来源关系或费用类型。",
        "sap_b1_source": "https://help.sap.com/doc/089315d8d0f8475a9fc84fb919b501a3/10.0/en-US/SDKhelp/PCH3.html"
      },
      "type": "VARCHAR",
      "displayName": "备注"
    },
    {
